<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine joblessness at 17-18 pct - Fernandez.</title>
<headline>Argentine joblessness at 17-18 pct - Fernandez.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's unemployment figure, to be announced next Wednesday, will be between 17 percent and 18 percent, Economy Minister Roque Fernandez said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The unemployment rate to be announced on the 18th will be around 17 percent or 17 and a bit percent,&quot; Fernandez told reporters.  </p>
<p>But Fernandez said unemployment should drop by two percentage points in 1997 and that over 100,000 jobs had been created over the past few years.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
